# README media: SKID KIDS. The GIF and the match shot are the demo player
# pressing real buttons; the draft is picked with buttons; the kangaroo's
# marbles and the robot's sweeper are thrown by player 2's buttons in a
# versus match set up with cheats.
shotscale 2
seed 26
game skidkids
wait 40
shot skidkids_title
# the draft: pick one, the CPU picks two, pick one more; one kid is left
press A
wait 10
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 90
press A
wait 30
shot skidkids_draft
# the tournament board and the demo player's first match
botuntil state == 5 2000
wait 30
shot skidkids_bracket
botuntil state == 7 2000
botplay 700
gifstart skidkids 3 2
botplay 540
gifstop

shot skidkids_match
# the final's talk: the kid nobody picked, and a friend
cheat round 5
wait 25
press A
wait 20
shot skidkids_final
# the kangaroo's marble bag, thrown by player 2
cheat versus 7 5 2 12
cheat play
cheat coach 0
cheat ctrl 1 3
cheat kid 3 250 100
cheat stars 3 2
cheat give 3 1
wait 30
hold P2B 70
waituntil marbles >= 8 400
wait 20
shot skidkids_kangaroo
# the robot's sweeper, called by player 2
cheat versus 0 1 9 13
cheat play
cheat coach 0
cheat ctrl 1 3
cheat loose 60 70
cheat loose 90 150
cheat loose 120 110
cheat stars 3 2
wait 40
press P2A
wait 4
press P2A
wait 44
shot skidkids_robot
